Telegram Footer Patch - Release Notes
======================================

This patch introduces a new footer feature for the Telegram integration,
enhancing message formatting and providing consistent attribution across
all outgoing communications.

Key Changes:
- Added configurable footer text to Telegram messages
- Implemented safe deployment workflow with validation checks
- Improved message consistency and branding

Deployment Flow:
1. Dry-run: Execute a test deployment to verify configuration without
   making actual changes to the live system.

2. Backup: Create a snapshot of current configurations before applying
   any modifications to ensure recovery is possible.

3. Rollback: If issues are detected during or after deployment, use the
   backup to restore the previous state quickly and safely.

4. Restart: After successful deployment, restart the Telegram service
   to apply all changes and verify the footer appears correctly.

This release follows the Model + Think + Context approach to ensure
reliable and maintainable code changes.

Version: 1.0.1
